- Cupertino Icons (https://github.com/flutter/packages): the Appearance
  Settings glyphs. MIT, see appearance/assets/LICENSE.cupertino-icons.
- The Classic theme's dark background, carried by the Appearance extension, is
  RepriseOS's themes/dark/background-dark-image.png by lgreitis (5ec8799).
  GPL-3.0-only.

Apple firmware is never included. Builds read it from the user's own IPSW.
